WEBVTT

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.810
Open the board and choose One-time rides.

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:06.710
Under pickup, choose on map. Tap University
Crossing.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.644
For drop-off, choose Enter address.

00:00:08.644 --> 00:00:13.660
Type the street number and street name. Leave
out the apartment number.

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:17.100
Choose Find area. The board selects Purdue
campus.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:20.060
Compare shared miles and extra driving.

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:26.460
Under More filters, select Can meet near
CityBus. Open the stop details to check the
route.

00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:29.847
Request an introduction, review the terms, and
send.

00:00:29.847 --> 00:00:34.510
After acceptance, open My activity to find the
shared email.

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:38.988
To post, select a ride or car sharing and enter
the details.

00:00:38.988 --> 00:00:43.698
You can have ten active posts and create ten
per rolling twenty-four hours.

00:00:43.698 --> 00:00:46.060
Review the terms and publish.

